---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & Legal Attribution - How To Live Better"
  description="Licensing, source attribution, medical/legal disclaimers, and privacy commitments for How To Live Better."
>
  <article class="prose-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="comic-sticker sticker-scope">Attribution & Legal</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">About This Project</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        A fast, mobile-first English translation of <em>How To Live Better</em>, built with an Apple-style glass interface and playful comic-layer illustrations.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Essential Legal & Attribution Notice (Non-Negotiable) -->
    <section class="info-card liquid-glass accent-border">
      <h2 class="card-heading">Licence & Source Attribution</h2>
      <p>
        This work is based on <a href="https://github.com/eternity4719/HowToLiveBetter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link"><strong>How To Live Better by eternity4719</strong></a>.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        The underlying text is licensed under the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link"><strong>Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)</strong></a>.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="attribution-quote">
        "Translated into English and reformatted for the web. Changes were made. Not endorsed by the author."
      </blockquote>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-ink-muted);">
        The web application code is open-source under the MIT License.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Geographic & Disclaimers -->
    <section class="info-card liquid-glass">
      <h2 class="card-heading">Mainland China Notice & Professional Deference</h2>
      <div class="callout-box">
        <strong>Geographic Context:</strong> Written for mainland China. Laws, public health guidelines, health insurance policies, and administrative procedures elsewhere may differ significantly.
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
        <strong>Crucial Caveat:</strong> The contents of this project are for informational and educational purposes only. Content may be outdated, incomplete, or wrong. Science and legislation evolve continuously.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        <strong>Readers should always defer to local authorities, qualified medical doctors, and licensed legal counsel</strong> before acting upon any medical, financial, or legal advice presented herein.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Privacy & Offline First -->
    <section class="info-card liquid-glass">
      <h2 class="card-heading">Zero-Tracking Privacy Promise</h2>
      <ul class="clean-list">
        <li><strong>No Analytics or Cookies:</strong> Zero telemetry, Google Analytics, trackers, or marketing beacons.</li>
        <li><strong>No Third-Party Network Requests:</strong> All web fonts and assets are 100% self-hosted.</li>
        <li><strong>Local Storage Only:</strong> Your reading progress, streaks, bookmarks, and settings remain exclusively in your browser's <code>localStorage</code>. Nothing is sent to any server.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- The Guide Totals -->
    <section class="info-card liquid-glass">
      <h2 class="card-heading">Dataset Totals & Coverage</h2>
      <p>The English edition maintains strict numerical and categorical fidelity with the Chinese source:</p>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-number">765</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Total Tips</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-number">495</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Evidence Grade A</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-number">122</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Very High ROI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-number">34</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Chapters</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="/start/" class="action-btn-secondary">Start Reading Guide</a>
      <a href="/chapters/" class="action-btn-primary">Browse Chapters →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-container {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .info-card {
    background: var(--color-glass-fill);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-glass-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glass);
  }

  .accent-border {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-jade);
  }

  .card-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .link {
    color: var(--color-jade);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .link:hover {
    color: var(--color-amber);
  }

  .attribution-quote {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-amber);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .callout-box {
    padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-amber) 12%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-amber) 30%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .clean-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .clean-list li {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .clean-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-jade);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 480px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .stat-box {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-glass-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--color-jade);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .action-btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-jade);
    color: #04110F;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 2px solid #04110F;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #04110F;
  }

  .action-btn-secondary {
    background: var(--color-glass-fill);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-glass-border);
  }
</style>
